config BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_PANEL
    bool "blackhand-panel"
    depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
    help
      Init sequence for the Waveshare 1.83" SPI panel. panel.txt is turned
      into panel.bin and linked into the kernel (CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE),
      because the built-in panel-mipi-dbi driver probes before the rootfs
      is mounted.
